cs:{"url.rights_disclaimer.prefix":"Ujist\u011bte se, \u017ee m\u00e1te ve\u0161ker\u00e1","url.rights_disclaimer.link":"pot\u0159ebn\u00e1 pr\u00e1va","url.rights_disclaimer.suffix":"k obsahu, kter\u00fd poskytujete.","upload_disclaimer.body.prefix":"Pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1n\u00edm t\u00e9to funkce potvrzujete, \u017ee m\u00e1te","upload_disclaimer.body.link":"pot\u0159ebn\u00e1 pr\u00e1va","upload_disclaimer.body.middle":"k obsahu, kter\u00fd nahrajete. Nevytv\u00e1\u0159ejte obsah, kter\u00fd poru\u0161uje autorsk\u00e1 pr\u00e1va nebo soukrom\u00ed jin\u00fdch osob. Va\u0161e pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1n\u00ed t\u00e9to generativn\u00ed slu\u017eby AI podl\u00e9h\u00e1 na\u0161im",
"upload_disclaimer.body.policy_link":"z\u00e1sad\u00e1m zak\u00e1zan\u00e9ho pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1n\u00ed","upload_disclaimer.body.suffix":".",disclaimer:"Pomelli m\u016f\u017ee ud\u011blat chybu, proto v\u00fdsledky pe\u010dliv\u011b kontrolujte.","disclaimer.ai_content":"P\u0159ipom\u00edn\u00e1me, \u017ee m\u016f\u017eete sami ur\u010dit, jak m\u00e1 obsah generovan\u00fd um\u011blou inteligenc\u00ed reprezentovat va\u0161i zna\u010dku.","disclaimer.learn_more":"P\u0159e\u010dt\u011bte si dal\u0161\u00ed informace.",
"disclaimer.professional":"Vytvo\u0159en\u00e9 v\u00fdstupy slou\u017e\u00ed pouze jako vod\u00edtko a nenahrazuj\u00ed odborn\u00e9 pr\u00e1vn\u00ed, marketingov\u00e9 nebo obchodn\u00ed poradenstv\u00ed.",sample_businesses:"Jedn\u00e1 se o vzorov\u00e9 firmy generovan\u00e9 um\u011blou inteligenc\u00ed s obecn\u00fdmi fiktivn\u00edmi n\u00e1zvy firem. Za ov\u011b\u0159en\u00ed spr\u00e1vnosti a leg\u00e1lnosti v\u0161ech kone\u010dn\u00fdch v\u00fdstup\u016f jste zodpov\u011bdn\u00ed vy.","settings.help_title":"Pomozte zlep\u0161it Pomelli pro v\u0161echny",
"settings.help_on":"Povolte pou\u017eit\u00ed va\u0161ich dat (v\u010detn\u011b va\u0161\u00ed firemn\u00ed DNA a dat z kampan\u00ed) k tr\u00e9nov\u00e1n\u00ed generativn\u00edch model\u016f um\u011bl\u00e9 inteligence spole\u010dnosti Google, d\u00edky \u010demu\u017e bude Pomelli lep\u0161\u00ed pro v\u00e1s i pro v\u0161echny, kdo ho pou\u017e\u00edvaj\u00ed. Z\u00e1le\u017e\u00ed n\u00e1m na ochran\u011b va\u0161eho soukrom\u00ed.","settings.learn_more":"Dal\u0161\u00ed informace","settings.help_on_tail":"Pokud je toto nastaven\u00ed vypnut\u00e9, va\u0161e \u00fadaje mohou b\u00fdt i nad\u00e1le pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1ny k lep\u0161\u00edmu odhalov\u00e1n\u00ed a reakci na podvody, zneu\u017eit\u00ed a poru\u0161en\u00ed",
"settings.help_off":"Va\u0161e budouc\u00ed data nebudou pou\u017eita ke zlep\u0161en\u00ed generativn\u00edch model\u016f um\u011bl\u00e9 inteligence spole\u010dnosti Google, s v\u00fdjimkou p\u0159\u00edpad\u016f, kdy po\u0161lete zp\u011btnou vazbu. Anonymizovan\u00e9 vzorky, kter\u00e9 ji\u017e byly p\u0159ezkoum\u00e1ny lidsk\u00fdmi recenzenty, budou ulo\u017eeny a\u017e po dobu t\u0159\u00ed let, a to i v p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b, \u017ee je odstran\u00edte.","settings.help_off_tail":"Pokud je toto nastaven\u00ed vypnut\u00e9, va\u0161e \u00fadaje mohou b\u00fdt i nad\u00e1le pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1ny k lep\u0161\u00edmu odhalov\u00e1n\u00ed a reakci na podvody, zneu\u017eit\u00ed a poru\u0161en\u00ed",
