"website.publish.rights_disclaimer":"P\u0159ed publikov\u00e1n\u00edm si ov\u011b\u0159te, zda m\u00e1te pot\u0159ebn\u00e1 pr\u00e1va k ve\u0161ker\u00e9mu obsahu uveden\u00e9mu na tomto webu.","website.publish.replace_live_warning":"Publikov\u00e1n\u00edm nahrad\u00edte aktu\u00e1ln\u00ed verzi. P\u0159ed publikov\u00e1n\u00edm si ov\u011b\u0159te, zda m\u00e1te pot\u0159ebn\u00e1 pr\u00e1va k ve\u0161ker\u00e9mu obsahu uveden\u00e9mu na tomto webu.","website.report_legal_issue":"Nahl\u00e1sit pr\u00e1vn\u00ed probl\u00e9m",
